},{"type":"html","id":"ggsyjB8EbYO_childItem_10","label":"ggsyjB8EbYO_childItem_10","default":"<p><strong>What Are The Supplement Facts?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggi7X8V8s4S_text","label":"ggi7X8V8s4S_text","default":"<p>Most men notice increased energy and focus within the first week. Significant testosterone-related benefits typically become apparent within 2-4 weeks of consistent use.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSJIpH8Wku_text","label":"ggSJIpH8Wku_text","default":"<p>Yes. All ingredients are natural, extensively researched, and used at clinically effective dosages. Chad Bites is manufactured in a GMP-certified facility in the USA with rigorous quality testing.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMy7YjzDtD_text","label":"ggMy7YjzDtD_text","default":"<p>No. Chad Bites contains only natural ingredients and does not contain any banned substances.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg83y19LvVP_text","label":"gg83y19LvVP_text","default":"<p>Chad Bites is designed to work synergistically with other supplements. However, if you're taking prescription medications or have health conditions, consult your doctor first.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1lS2JxbKV_text","label":"gg1lS2JxbKV_text","default":"<p>Gummies offer superior absorption compared to capsules because the active ingredients are already broken down and ready for your body to absorb. Plus, they taste great, so you'll actually want to take them consistently.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfYm-o1n4i_text","label":"ggfYm-o1n4i_text","default":"<p>Each bottle contains 60 gummies (30-day supply at 2 gummies per day). &nbsp;However, many Chad Bites users to take 4-6 gummies per day for faster results.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxTMb5W6FI_text","label":"ggxTMb5W6FI_text","default":"<p>We offer a 365-day money-back guarantee. If you're not satisfied, contact us and we'll refund your most recent order, no questions asked.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTzkg_JGfU_text","label":"ggTzkg_JGfU_text","default":"<p>No. Chad Bites is designed for daily, long-term use. The ingredients support your body's natural testosterone production rather than replacing it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggz0GLYUBC-_text","label":"ggz0GLYUBC-_text","default":"<p>We recommend sticking to 2 gummies daily as that's the recommended effective dose. Due to the potency of our formula, you should not exceed more than 6 gummies per day.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQ4J7FBBil_text","label":"ggQ4J7FBBil_text","default":"<p>Absolutely. In fact, men over 40-50 often see the most dramatic results as this is when testosterone naturally declines the most.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5YQOsYz9f_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg5YQOsYz9f_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0896/0851/9991/files/ingredients.jpg?v=1738002433"}],
